## Context
Parent tracker: 1346.
Child of tracker 1346, split by raid 0a53b8 (2026-10-29) under the monster checklist: 1346 bundled a
census that can run now and a paid outcome trial that needs the author's spend approval.
The census is 1346's first exit criterion. Evidence and scope: 1346 § Context and § Scope (first bullet).

## Scope
Extend `scripts/census/memory-recall.py` (or a sibling) to count reads of repository memory
(`memory/MEMORY.md`, `memory/topics/`) per runtime (Claude Code, Codex, Pi) and per host
(padme, and doudou where reachable), main sessions and subagent transcripts separately, since a
date. Reuse the audit's scans (`conception/2026-10-29-memory-system-audit/repo_mem_reads.py`,
`codex_mem.py`) rather than writing a third. A positive control proves the probe sees reads.

## Exit criteria
- [ ] One command prints read counts per runtime, host and session kind, with a positive control line
- [ ] Its result for padme since 2026-10-15 is recorded on 1346
- [ ] Tests cover the counting on fixture transcripts
